  "text": "proprium.dominica-iii-post-epiphaniam-evangelium",
  "about": "The evangelium of the formulary “Third Sunday after Epiphany” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "At that time, when Jesus had come down from the mountain, great multitudes followed Him. And behold, a leper came and adored Him, saying: Lord, if You are willing, You can make me clean. Jesus stretched out His hand, touched him, and said: I am willing; be made clean. Immediately his leprosy was cleansed. Jesus said to him: See that you tell no one; but go, show yourself to the priest and offer the gift which Moses commanded, for a testimony to them. But when He had entered Capharnaum, a centurion came to Him, beseeching Him and saying: Lord, my servant lies at home paralyzed and is grievously tormented. Jesus said to him: I will come and heal him. The centurion said in reply: Lord, I am not worthy that You should enter under my roof; but only say the word, and my servant will be healed. For I also am a man placed under authority, having soldiers under me; and I say to this one: Go, and he goes; and to another: Come, and he comes; and to my servant: Do this, and he does it. Jesus, on hearing this, marveled and said to those who followed Him: Amen I say to you, I have not found such great faith in Israel. I say to you, however, that many will come from the East and the West and will sit down with Abraham and Isaac and Jacob in the kingdom of heaven, but the children of the kingdom will be cast out into the outer darkness; there will be weeping and gnashing of teeth. Jesus said to the centurion: Go, and as you have believed, let it be done for you. And the servant was healed in that hour.", "alignments": [{ "words": ["w005", "w006"], "anchor": "w005", "gloss": "Jesus had come down" }, { "words": ["w009", "w010", "w011", "w012", "w013"], "anchor": "w009", "gloss": "great multitudes followed Him" }, { "words": ["w024", "w025", "w026"], "anchor": "w024", "gloss": "You can make me clean" }, { "words": ["w028", "w029", "w030"], "anchor": "w028", "gloss": "Jesus, stretching out His hand," }, { "words": ["w038", "w039", "w040", "w041"], "anchor": "w038", "gloss": "his leprosy was cleansed" }, { "words": ["w043", "w044", "w045"], "anchor": "w043", "gloss": "Jesus said to him" }, { "words": ["w046", "w047", "w048"], "anchor": "w046", "gloss": "See that you tell no one" }, { "words": ["w058", "w059"], "anchor": "w058", "gloss": "Moses commanded" }, { "words": ["w063", "w064", "w065"], "anchor": "w063", "gloss": "But when He had entered" }, { "words": ["w067", "w068", "w069", "w070"], "anchor": "w067", "gloss": "a centurion came to Him" }, { "words": ["w076", "w077"], "anchor": "w076", "gloss": "my servant" }, { "words": ["w083", "w084"], "anchor": "w083", "gloss": "is grievously tormented" }, { "words": ["w086", "w087", "w088"], "anchor": "w086", "gloss": "Jesus said to him" }, { "words": ["w095", "w096", "w097"], "anchor": "w095", "gloss": "the centurion said in reply" }, { "words": ["w099", "w100"], "anchor": "w100", "gloss": "I am not" }, { "words": ["w104", "w105", "w106"], "anchor": "w104", "gloss": "under my roof" }, { "words": ["w109", "w110"], "anchor": "w109", "gloss": "say the word" }, { "words": ["w112", "w113", "w114"], "anchor": "w112", "gloss": "my servant will be healed" }, { "words": ["w118", "w119", "w120", "w121", "w122"], "anchor": "w118", "gloss": "am a man placed under authority" }, { "words": ["w123", "w124", "w125", "w126"], "anchor": "w123", "gloss": "having soldiers under me" }, { "words": ["w139", "w140"], "anchor": "w139", "gloss": "to my servant" }, { "words": ["w145", "w146", "w147", "w148", "w149"], "anchor": "w145", "gloss": "On hearing this, however, Jesus marveled" }, { "words": ["w151", "w152", "w153"], "anchor": "w151", "gloss": "said to those following Him" }, { "words": ["w157", "w158"], "anchor": "w158", "gloss": "I have not found" }, { "words": ["w184", "w185", "w186"], "anchor": "w184", "gloss": "but the children of the kingdom" }, { "words": ["w189", "w190"], "anchor": "w189", "gloss": "the outer darkness" }, { "words": ["w198", "w199"], "anchor": "w198", "gloss": "Jesus said" }, { "words": ["w205", "w206"], "anchor": "w205", "gloss": "let it be done for you" }, { "words": ["w208", "w209", "w210"], "anchor": "w208", "gloss": "the servant was healed" }] }
